      "id": "claim_52d125a1befa48f9aa4026fe6dcafcda",
      "statement": "Server Actions (app/actions/*, marked \"use server\") are the primary type-safe mutation pattern invoked from React, returning typed results, calling revalidatePath, and deferring follow-up work (broadcast, instant scoring, round advancement) into Next.js after() so it runs post-response at full function CPU priority.",
