      "statement": "State is broadcast to clients over Supabase Realtime: the server calls publishMatchState (statePublisher.ts) to send a 'state' broadcast on the match:<matchId> channel using the service-role client, treating delivery as best-effort with a short subscribe timeout, while clients subscribe with the anon client via subscribeToMatchChannel listening for state, round-summary, and rematch events.",
